                "type": "path",
                "description": "The organization name"
              },
              {
                "name": "hookName",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "The webhook name identifier"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Returns the recent delivery history for a specific webhook, including the HTTP status code, response time, request payload, and delivery timestamp for each attempt. This allows monitoring webhook health and diagnosing delivery failures. Each delivery includes a unique Pulumi-Webhook-ID."
        },
